OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest over woman's death
OL,4,
OL,5,FA 58-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,6,Fsuspicion of murder after a woman was
OL,7,Ffound dead at a property in Spalding.
OL,9,FLincolnshire Police said the woman,
OL,10,Faged in her 50s, was discovered at an
OL,11,Faddress in Gaunt Close on Monday
OL,12,Fevening.
OL,14,FAn investigation has been launched and
OL,15,Fofficers are treating the death as
OL,16,Funexplained.
OL,18,FDet Ch Insp Claire Rimmer said she did
OL,19,Fnot believe there was any wider threat
OL,20,Fto the community.
